          ],
          "confidence": "high"
        },
        {
          "text": "In FY2027Q2, revenue was 96,221 USD millions, up 105.8% year over year and 17.9% quarter over quarter.",
          "source_ids": [
            "c1a63d8899"
          ],
          "confidence": "high"
        },
        {
          "text": "Net income increased from 680 USD millions in FY2023Q3 to 59,688 USD millions in FY2027Q2.",
